  "description": "BGE-M3 is a unified fine-tuned embedding model that supports over 100 languages and handles inputs ranging from short sentences to long documents of up to 8192 tokens. It can simultaneously perform dense retrieval, multi-vector retrieval, and sparse retrieval (lexical matching) without additional costs for token weights. The model is designed for hybrid retrieval pipelines in RAG systems and surpasses models like OpenAI in benchmarks across English and other languages.",
